OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist avoids jail after woman  
OL,4,Akilled in crash                        
OL,6,FDrake, who pleaded guilty last month to
OL,7,Fcausing death by careless driving, was 
OL,8,Fsentenced at Lincoln Crown Court on    
OL,9,FFriday to eight months in prison,      
OL,10,Fsuspended for 18 months.               
